{"id":"37a3e43a3599a849","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-iterated-ultrapower.md","title":"Normal-Measure Iteration Theorem","display":"thm-iterated-ultrapower — Normal-Measure Iteration Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapower","aliases":["58-thm-iterated-ultrapower"],"display":"thm-iterated-ultrapower — Normal-Measure Iteration Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model]]","[[58-df-wellfounded]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[../batch19/58-df-quotient]]","[[58-df-mostowski]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-iterated-ultrapower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-iterated-ultrapower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-iterated-ultrapower — Normal-Measure Iteration Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e059389c097fae1\" href=\"?note=2e059389c097fae1\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"58-df-wellfounded\">58-df-wellfounded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ced46394294c1a6\" href=\"?note=9ced46394294c1a6\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-quotient\">../batch19/58-df-quotient</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b6ec5105268243bd\" href=\"?note=b6ec5105268243bd\" title=\"58-df-mostowski\">58-df-mostowski</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (a transitive set model), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,U\\in M\">\\(\\kappa,U\\in M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\\)</span> (metatheoretic construction predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i\\coloneqq\\vec M(i)\">\\(M_i\\coloneqq\\vec M(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_i\\coloneqq\\vec\\kappa(i)\">\\(\\kappa_i\\coloneqq\\vec\\kappa(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i\\coloneqq\\vec U(i)\">\\(U_i\\coloneqq\\vec U(i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_{ih}\\coloneqq\\vec j(\\langle i,h\\rangle)\">\\(j_{ih}\\coloneqq\\vec j(\\langle i,h\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle j_{i\\lambda}:i&lt;\\lambda\\rangle\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,\\vec j(\\langle i,\\lambda\\rangle)\\rangle:i&lt;\\lambda\\}\">\\(\\langle j_{i\\lambda}:i&lt;\\lambda\\rangle\\coloneqq\\{\\langle i,\\vec j(\\langle i,\\lambda\\rangle)\\rangle:i&lt;\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S(N,j;M,\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F,E_U,Q,R_U,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nF=\\{f\\in M:\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E_U=\n\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in F\\times F:\n\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)=g(\\xi)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,F,E_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R_U=\n\\{\\langle[f]_{E_U},[g]_{E_U}\\rangle:f,g\\in F\\land\n\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)\\in g(\\xi)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(Q,R_U,N,\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists c\\in F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(c(\\xi)=x)\n\\land j(x)=\\pi([c]_{E_U})\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}internal\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S(N,j;M,\\kappa,U)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F,E_U,Q,R_U,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nF=\\{f\\in M:\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\kappa,M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E_U=\n\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in F\\times F:\n\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)=g(\\xi)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,F,E_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R_U=\n\\{\\langle[f]_{E_U},[g]_{E_U}\\rangle:f,g\\in F\\land\n\\{\\xi\\in\\kappa:f(\\xi)\\in g(\\xi)\\}\\in U\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(Q,R_U,N,\\pi)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists c\\in F\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(c(\\xi)=x)\n\\land j(x)=\\pi([c]_{E_U})\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S(N,\\vec k;\\vec M,\\vec j,\\lambda)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec M),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\lambda\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec j),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\n\\land\\forall i\\leq h&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,h\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec j)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j_{ih},M_i,M_h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec k,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec k))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,E,Q,R,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nD=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i&lt;\\lambda\\land x\\in M_i\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle i,x\\rangle,\\langle j,y\\rangle\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\exists k&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(i,j\\leq k\n\\land j_{ik}(x)=j_{jk}(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,D,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle[\\langle i,x\\rangle]_E,[\\langle j,y\\rangle]_E\\rangle:\ni,j&lt;\\lambda\\land x\\in M_i\\land y\\in M_j\\land\\exists k&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(i,j\\leq k\n\\land j_{ik}(x)\\in j_{jk}(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(Q,R,N,\\pi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec k(i),M_i,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M_i\\;\n\\vec k(i)(x)=\\pi([\\langle i,x\\rangle]_E)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}direct\\text{-}limit}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S(N,\\vec k;\\vec M,\\vec j,\\lambda)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec M),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\\land\\lambda\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec j),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\n\\land\\forall i\\leq h&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(\\langle i,h\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec j)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j_{ih},M_i,M_h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec k,\\lambda,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec k))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,E,Q,R,\\pi\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\nD=\\{\\langle i,x\\rangle:i&lt;\\lambda\\land x\\in M_i\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle\\langle i,x\\rangle,\\langle j,y\\rangle\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\exists k&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(i,j\\leq k\n\\land j_{ik}(x)=j_{jk}(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,D,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land R=\\Bigl\\{\n\\langle[\\langle i,x\\rangle]_E,[\\langle j,y\\rangle]_E\\rangle:\ni,j&lt;\\lambda\\land x\\in M_i\\land y\\in M_j\\land\\exists k&lt;\\lambda\\;\\bigl(i,j\\leq k\n\\land j_{ik}(x)\\in j_{jk}(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{MostowskiCollapse}_S(Q,R,N,\\pi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec k(i),M_i,N)\n\\land\\forall x\\in M_i\\;\n\\vec k(i)(x)=\\pi([\\langle i,x\\rangle]_E)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\n(\\mathcal I;M,\\kappa,U,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec M,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U,\\vec j\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal I=\\langle\\vec M,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U,\\vec j\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\kappa))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec U))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,\\{\\langle i,h\\rangle\\in(\\alpha+1)\\times(\\alpha+1):i\\leq h\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq h\\leq\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{Function}(j_{ih},M_i,M_h)\n&amp;\\quad\\land M_0=M\\land\\kappa_0=\\kappa\\land U_0=U\n\\land\\forall i\\leq\\alpha\\;(\n\\kappa_i=j_{0i}(\\kappa)\\land U_i=j_{0i}(U))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S\n(M_{i+1},j_{i,i+1};M_i,\\kappa_i,U_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\to\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S\n(M_\\lambda,\\langle j_{i\\lambda}:i&lt;\\lambda\\rangle;\n\\vec M,\\vec j,\\lambda)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{WF}(\\in\\cap(M_i\\times M_i),M_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\leq k\\leq\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nj_{ii}=\\operatorname{id}_{M_i}\n\\land j_{ik}=j_{jk}\\circ j_{ij}\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}measure\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\n(\\mathcal I;M,\\kappa,U,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\vec M,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U,\\vec j\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal I=\\langle\\vec M,\\vec\\kappa,\\vec U,\\vec j\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec M,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec M))\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\kappa,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\kappa))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\alpha+1,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec U))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec j,\\{\\langle i,h\\rangle\\in(\\alpha+1)\\times(\\alpha+1):i\\leq h\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec j))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq h\\leq\\alpha\\;\\mathrm{Function}(j_{ih},M_i,M_h)\n&amp;\\quad\\land M_0=M\\land\\kappa_0=\\kappa\\land U_0=U\n\\land\\forall i\\leq\\alpha\\;(\n\\kappa_i=j_{0i}(\\kappa)\\land U_i=j_{0i}(U))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i&lt;\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{InternalUltrapower}_S\n(M_{i+1},j_{i,i+1};M_i,\\kappa_i,U_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\to\n\\mathrm{DirectLimitSystem}_S\n(M_\\lambda,\\langle j_{i\\lambda}:i&lt;\\lambda\\rangle;\n\\vec M,\\vec j,\\lambda)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq\\alpha\\;\n\\mathrm{WF}(\\in\\cap(M_i\\times M_i),M_i)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall i\\leq j\\leq k\\leq\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\nj_{ii}=\\operatorname{id}_{M_i}\n\\land j_{ik}=j_{jk}\\circ j_{ij}\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\kappa,U\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathcal I\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\n(\\mathcal I;M,\\kappa,U,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ultrapower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\n\\land\\kappa,U\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalMeasure}_S(U,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathcal I\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{NormalMeasureIteration}_S\n(\\mathcal I;M,\\kappa,U,\\alpha).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each successor ultrapower uses the functions that belong to the current model. The former expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_i^{\\kappa_i}/U_i\">\\(M_i^{\\kappa_i}/U_i\\)</span> used every external function and therefore was not the model ultrapower whose canonical embedding is elementary.</li>\n<li>Limit stages are coherent direct limits, and every stage is required to have a well-founded membership relation before taking its transitive collapse.</li>\n<li>Direct limits and class-length iteration are not constructed by the available set-level atoms, so the construction is explicitly metatheoretic rather than expressed through unregistered isomorphism and colimit symbols under an object-language turnstile.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure","status":"resolved","id":"2e059389c097fae1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-normal-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"a913